# ============================================================
# Kingsboard .gitignore
#   Kingsboard Client/Kingsboard Client  -> Unity project
#   Kingsboard Server                    -> .NET gRPC server, ProtoLibrary, TestConsole
# Note: ProtoLibrary/Generated/ is intentionally TRACKED — the Unity
# client consumes it as a local package and does not run Grpc.Tools.
# ============================================================

